# The committed Icechunk store is binary in every file, including the small
# metadata ones: git only guesses that from an early NUL byte, and a
# regenerated repo/snapshot file without one would be CRLF-mangled under
# core.autocrlf and stop parsing.
examples/data/station_temps.icechunk/** binary

# Same reasoning for the golden repo written by icechunk-python (the one
# fixture in tests/fixtures/icechunk_repos/ that IS committed): its metadata
# files are zstd frames and its chunk files are raw float64 cells. Neither is
# text, and neither survives an end-of-line conversion.
tests/fixtures/icechunk_repos/golden_py/** binary
